// For tests/canton_external.sh only: a participant that exists before Ostia comes, as a validator's does. Starts the synchronizer
// and the operator participant of network/canton/canton.conf and connects the participant. It makes no party, no user and no package, and
// uploads nothing: that is network/external/setup.py's work. The other two participants of canton.conf are not started.
sequencer1.start()
mediator1.start()
operator.start()
bootstrap.synchronizer_local()
operator.synchronizers.connect_local(sequencer1, alias = "da")
println("EXTERNAL PARTICIPANT READY")
